In general, all of Ultimate Rath's abilities are enhanced compared to his [[Rath (Classic)|devolved counterpart]].{{Refn|[[:File:Ultimate Rath has enhanced abilities.png]]|group = DJW}}

Ultimate Rath is strong enough to carry a fairly large and bulky blaster.<ref name="MA">''[[Malgax Attacks]]''</ref>

Ultimate Rath was durable enough to withstand blasts from [[Luhley]]'s [[Plumbers (Classic)|Plumber]] blaster.<ref name="MA" />

Ultimate Rath can jump exceptionally high, as shown when he jumped out of Azmuth's lab through a hole in the roof.<ref name="MA" />

Ultimate Rath was shown leaping on all fours which implies he maintaned his quadrupedalism.<ref name="MA" />

Ultimate Rath has two claws extended from his wrists and has smaller claws on each of his fingers and toes.

==History==
===Omniverse===
*Ultimate Rath first appeared in ''[[Malgax Attacks]]'', where he was used by [[Albedo]] to seemingly kill [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]] and chased an angered [[Luhley]] before a restored Azmuth disabled his Ultimatrix.

