==Trivia==
*Negative Ultimate Rath is the final [[Ultimate Forms|Ultimate form]], as well as the final alien that [[Albedo]] transforms into, seen on-screen in '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', as well as in the Classic Continuity in general.
*In the comic ''[[One Man's Trash]]'', [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] attempts to turn into Ultimate Rath but fails due to the transformation being a joke at the time.
*When asked what Ultimate form he would really like to see, [[Eugene Son]] chose Ultimate Rath.{{Refn|[[:File:DNAliens Are Not a Species.png]]|group = ES}}
*Negative Ultimate Rath was designed by [[Steven Choi]] alongside [[Chap Yaep]] and Dou Hong.{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick's work on the Ultimate forms.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
*Negative Ultimate Rath's design and outfit strongly resemble that of [[Wikipedia:Marvel Comics|Marvel Comics]] characters such as [[Wikipedia:Wolverine (character)|Wolverine]], [[Wikipedia:Sabretooth (comics)|Sabretooth]] and [[Wikipedia:Kraven the Hunter|Kraven the Hunter]] respectively.

